  <content>
  <section><para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
<section class="check-understanding"><exercise data-content-id="75ab0de5-d0d8-464a-8fc5-06a2360884f3"><problem><para>
      <para>1. <emphasis>Select three</emphasis> the equations that have the same solution as the equation \(3x-12=24\).</para>
    </para></problem><solution><para>["\\(15x-60=120\\)", "\\(3x=36\\)", "\\(x-4=8\\)"]</para><para>
      <para>The correct answers are \(15x-60=120,\;3x=36,\;x-4=8\). </para>
    </para></solution></exercise></section></section>
</content>
